/T (Telecom strategy refers to actions taken by major network operators to influence market share, pricing \(tariffs\), and service quality. In India, the market is primarily controlled by three giants: Reliance Jio, Bharti Airtel, and Vodafone Idea \(Vi\). Their primary objective is to maintain subscriber growth while balancing the massive capital expenditures required for 5G infrastructure.)
