388 0 obj
<<
/Title (An aggressive approach \(historically used by Jio\) involves slashing tariffs or offering free data to capture market share rapidly. A conservative/consolidation approach \(currently used by Jio and Airtel\) involves raising tariffs to increase ARPU \(Average Revenue Per User\) and stabilize profitability.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 378 0 R
/Next 389 0 R
>>
endobj
